# Markdown and scripts are the whole content. Normalise to LF in the repository and in every
# checkout, so edits from different tools and machines do not produce whole-file diffs, and
# byte comparisons in verify.sh are not defeated by CRLF. Every tool used here handles LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
